    "synopsis": {
        "native": "En 1975, Seyolo Zantoko, m\u00e9decin fraichement dipl\u00f4m\u00e9 originaire de Kinshasa, saisit l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 d\u2019un poste de m\u00e9decin de campagne dans un petit village fran\u00e7ais. Arriv\u00e9s \u00e0 Marly-Gomont, Seyolo et sa famille d\u00e9chantent. Les habitants ont peur, ils n\u2019ont jamais vu de noirs de leur vie. Mais Seyolo est bien d\u00e9cid\u00e9 \u00e0 r\u00e9ussir son pari et va tout mettre en \u0153uvre pour gagner la confiance des villageois...",
        "english": "In 1975, Seyolo Zantoko, a graduate doctor from Kinshasa, grabs the opportunity of becoming a country doctor in a small French village. When they arrive in Marly-Gomont, Seyolo and his family quickly become disillusioned. The village inhabitants are afraid, this is the first time they've ever seen African people. But Seyolo is determined to suceed and will do everything he can to win the villagers' trust."
